WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.610
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.780
So far on Aikatsu Stars!

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:16.450
I'm a second-year at the idol middle school, Four Star Academy.

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:21.700
As a top idol in S4, I work hard at my Aikatsu every day.

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:25.630
I got to appear on Hime-senpai's show along with Aria-chan.

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:31.170
Aria-chan brought a sense of freshness and fun to everything we did.

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:36.510
During that time, Hime-senpai suggested that I perform a duet with her.

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:42.520
Through our lessons and performance, I rediscovered the fun in Aikatsu.

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:48.400
I'll continue loving Aikatsu from the bottom of my heart,
 and become the world's brightest star one day!

00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:51.400
Now for another day of Aikatsu!

00:00:54.030 --> 00:01:00.950
Attention! It is once again time for 
Four Star Academy's annual school festival!

00:01:01.370 --> 00:01:03.500
Idols of our school!

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:08.250
Let's show our visitors the time of their lives!

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:11.550
And to everyone else who lives in Kirakira City!

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:18.300
Old or young, boy or girl, we invite you one and all to come on down and enjoy yourselves at the academy!

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:22.140
We promise you will not leave disappointed!

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:25.350
It's almost time for the school festival!

00:01:25.350 --> 00:01:30.570
This will be our first year doing it as S4. 
We have to show everyone what we've got!

00:01:30.570 --> 00:01:32.860
Sounds like you're really into this.

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:40.870
That's because the main event's gonna be a play put on by S4 and us admins, right Ako?

00:01:40.870 --> 00:01:46.040
Exactly. How could I even lead Theater Class if I wasn't counting the seconds left?

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:47.620
You got that right!

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:51.210
Yeah! Let's do our best, Ako-chan!

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:52.960
You can count on it!

00:01:54.340 --> 00:01:56.010
I'm getting pumped up!

00:01:56.380 --> 00:01:58.260
I can't wait for the festival!

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:46.330
Elza Forte. A global top idol and celebrated designer.

00:03:47.490 --> 00:03:52.870
In addition, she's starred in Hollywood movies and performed recitals at Carnegie Hall.

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:57.130
Elza is an idol who has the entire world and more.

00:03:57.630 --> 00:04:01.970
If that weren't enough, she's immovable from the top of the Aikatsu Ranking. {I know what you were going for, but I couldn't read rock in that context easily}

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:05.640
And yet, the lady herself appears to be unsatisfied.

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:07.850
You know why.

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:10.640
What is it that I wish for most?

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:13.390
The Sun Dress.

00:04:14.150 --> 00:04:19.230
The Star Premium Rare Coords and their respective Star Wings have all materialized.

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:24.950
So why is it that the Sun Dress refuses to appear before me?

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:28.530
What am I lacking?! {it's so minor, and yet. I hope you don't notice this so we can both be happy}

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:31.700
Does this mean I'm not perfect yet?!

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:35.830
Elza, it does you no good to lose your composure.

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:41.090
Hey, hey!

00:04:41.090 --> 00:04:43.590
Ako-chan just called me!

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:49.060
She invited us all to go see their school festival!

00:04:49.060 --> 00:04:50.470
School festival!

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:54.640
Kirara-san says that it's some kind of wonderful party!

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:58.360
I want to go! I very much want to go!

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:02.110
Elza, why don't we all go together?

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:07.110
I'll pass. You go on your own.

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:19.630
Now then, I would like to do a final rundown of the booths that will be at the school festival.

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:25.880
The admins will operate an animal-suit café specializing in tea parties named "Soothe" {WuG meets Blend S}

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:30.260
as well as a giant flower arrangement called "Big is Splendiferous".

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:37.520
As there are many ambitious booths 
this year, we must be extra prepared.

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:38.770
Okay.

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:45.780
So just to go over our booths again, Yume's doing "variety takoyaki"?

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:49.780
Yep. I'm thinking about the sauces now.

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:54.700
Ako's doing latte art... what are you planning to draw?

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:56.910
Isn't that obvious?

00:05:57.250 --> 00:06:00.670
My beloved Subaru-kyun!

00:06:00.670 --> 00:06:03.840
A hint of bitterness with notes of sweetness.

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:09.140
I'll make caffè latte drizzled with the slightly mature bittersweet taste of caramel!

00:06:09.140 --> 00:06:11.430
Is that supposed to taste good?

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:13.970
I'm testing recipes as we speak.

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:19.560
So I'm making crêpes, and Yuzu-senpai is doing... cotton candy art?

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:21.190
I'm done!

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:24.070
Check it!

00:06:24.070 --> 00:06:25.860
That's so cute!

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:27.070
Wow!

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:30.030
It would be a waste to eat this!

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:31.780
Girls!

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:35.450
I knew you'd be here!

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:39.170
Come on, you'll be late for the meeting.

00:06:39.170 --> 00:06:41.380
Everyone else is waiting.

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:42.460
Got it!

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:44.840
Let's get to it.

00:06:44.840 --> 00:06:49.340
We're having our first rehearsal for 
Romeo and Juliet, Four Star version!

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:50.220
Okay!

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:55.970
But before that, as Chief Producer Yuzu, I want to go over everyone's positions.

00:06:56.390 --> 00:07:00.850
First, the script and screenplay are being done by Lilienne. Ako-chan's the director.

00:07:00.850 --> 00:07:04.730
Koharu-chan and Mahiru-chan are in charge of costume design.

00:07:04.730 --> 00:07:09.110
Yume-chan and Rola-chan are leading the set and artwork team.

00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:11.070
Now for the casting.

00:07:11.070 --> 00:07:12.990
Juliet is Lilienne!

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:15.240
Romeo's Yuri-chan.

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:16.620
And also...

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:22.750
I'm back! It's Haruka☆!

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:26.880
Four Stars idols... {woot woot}

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:30.380
Get your excitement up, up, up! {pretty sure this was excitement, but rukaruka}{but tension means excitement}{rip my silliness}

00:07:31.550 --> 00:07:34.390
Are you guys ready for the school festival?

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:38.520
Subaru-kun and Kanata-kun, you two are doing manzai comedy, right?

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:40.020
We're all set!

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:43.230
We'll have the audience roaring with laughter.

00:07:43.230 --> 00:07:45.400
Really? I'd like to see that.

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:48.530
We're going to be fine, but how about you?

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:52.570
Asahi's doing magic tricks, and Nozomu is telling fortunes...

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:55.570
What's with that outfit?

00:07:55.570 --> 00:07:57.830
You look like a sorcerer.

00:07:57.830 --> 00:07:59.290
Thank you.

00:07:59.290 --> 00:08:01.960
I'll take that as a compliment.

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:07.550
Let's go through the balcony scene one more time!

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:13.220
O Romeo! Wherefore art thou Romeo? {slightly rewritten at parts}{I'll believe you in}

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:17.010
'Tis but thy name that is my enemy.

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:20.680
I ask of thee, do doff thy name!

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:25.730
I take thee at thy word. Henceforth shall I be...

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:28.690
Yes, call me but love!

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:30.440
Stop, enough!

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:35.950
Unless you can fully take on Romeo's feelings, you'll never be able to move the audience!

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:38.080
How do I do that?

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:42.500
It is as the famous theater practitioner, Stanislavski, once said—

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:45.370
"Do not act; become."

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:48.090
So basically, I need to fall in love with Lily.

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:50.380
Yes! That's precisely it!

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:55.510
Good, then let's take it from the top.

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:56.470
Okay!

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:09.520
It's tomorrow.

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:10.730
Yeah.

00:09:10.730 --> 00:09:14.240
Thinking about how our hard work's about to pay off has my heart racing.

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:16.740
That script was pretty tough.

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:18.780
What are you saying?

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:21.120
This is Aikatsu too.

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:23.500
You've got to go out there and nail it!

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:25.460
Right!

00:09:39.720 --> 00:09:41.810
Welcome, visitors.

00:09:41.810 --> 00:09:48.440
We sincerely thank you for participating in Four Star Academy's school festival.

00:09:48.440 --> 00:09:52.270
Please enjoy the festivities to the fullest.

00:09:53.940 --> 00:09:56.030
Here you are. Thanks for waiting.

00:09:56.360 --> 00:09:59.910
Koala cotton candy. The best part is all the different colors.

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:01.530
Thanks!

00:10:01.530 --> 00:10:05.040
Hey, Yume! You're letting the line get too long!

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:09.790
I can't keep up!

00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:12.550
Yume-chan! We came to lend a hand!

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:14.800
Koharu-chan!

00:10:19.890 --> 00:10:21.720
Thank you for coming.

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:25.100
There's finally a lull.

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:27.350
You saved me...

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:28.850
But now that I look...

00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:32.610
Matcha, chocolate, and cream sauces?

00:10:32.610 --> 00:10:34.360
Want to try?

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:36.610
N-Nice colors...

00:10:37.490 --> 00:10:39.700
Do they even taste good?

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:42.660
Just pretend I didn't warn you and eat one.

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:52.330
A-Are you okay?

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:54.460
How is this so delicious?!

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:55.630
Huh?

00:10:56.760 --> 00:10:58.630
I can't stop myself!

00:10:58.630 --> 00:11:00.130
I know!

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:02.720
Do you have any more, Nijino-san?

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:04.390
There's plenty left!

00:11:06.470 --> 00:11:08.980
Yuri-senpai, you shouldn't eat so many...

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:11.150
I'm fine, don't worry!

00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:14.650
Really, takoyaki?

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:16.780
Isn't that basically cannibalism for you?

00:11:17.990 --> 00:11:21.780
Excuse you! How about buying some instead of just loitering?

00:11:21.780 --> 00:11:23.780
I recommend the chocolate!

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:28.290
Sure. I'd feel bad if you couldn't sell out, so I'll take them.

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:32.920
Thank you for your purchase!

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:35.250
Seriously?

00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:39.550
Koharu-chan!

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:41.470
How's it going?

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:43.510
Asahi-senpai!

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:46.220
I haven't gotten the hang of cooking these yet.

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:49.640
I want a box of ones you made.

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:51.140
Sure!

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:55.020
What is this?

00:11:55.980 --> 00:11:56.980
A kappa?

00:11:56.980 --> 00:11:59.280
Keep your snark to yourself!

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:01.860
Maybe it's a merman.

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:09.160
Ako-chan! We came!

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:12.000
It took you long enough.

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:13.460
Sorry!

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:15.830
Huh? Where's Elza-san?

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:18.460
She wasn't quite in the mood.

00:12:18.460 --> 00:12:21.220
It's disappointing. Very disappointing.

00:12:21.220 --> 00:12:23.180
I see...

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:27.220
Oh yeah, Ako-chan. I heard you're doing a play.

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:29.770
I'm really looking forward to it!

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:31.600
What play are you doing?

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:33.980
Romeo and Juliet.

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:39.730
Oh? I've actually seen an Off-Off-Broadway production of that. {today I learned that this is a thing}

00:12:39.730 --> 00:12:44.240
I found it rather intriguing, so I even picked up a screenplay to read myself.

00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:48.620
That looks interesting.

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:50.870
Kirara wants to spin some too!

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:53.080
Sure, want to try?

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:54.120
Yes!

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:56.040
Honestly.

00:12:56.040 --> 00:12:58.880
If you'd like, I can give you a tour around campus.

00:12:59.170 --> 00:13:00.500
Are you sure?

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:04.430
Thankfully, Mahiru's Crêpes managed to sell out.

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:07.220
Then I'll accept.

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:11.060
It looks like everyone's having fun.

00:13:11.060 --> 00:13:11.890
Yeah.

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:28.530
What's this?

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:30.990
A fortune-telling hut.

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:36.290
I can see it. It's becoming clearer.

00:13:36.290 --> 00:13:41.500
In the near future, you will save someone from a tight situation.

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:45.590
Upon doing so, you will have a revelation.{I knew you'd do this}

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:49.220
Here.

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:50.800
Thanks.

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:55.600
Come to think of it, does Venus Ark hold a school festival?

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:59.610
We do, but it's nowhere near as extravagant as this.

00:13:59.610 --> 00:14:02.320
That's why I find this so intriguing.

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:04.320
I understand.

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:08.570
I should start getting ready for the play.

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:14.080
Hang on, what's going on here?

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:21.460
Yuri-senpai got a stomachache from eating too much chocolate takoyaki.

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:25.090
This is a problem. We don't have much time until curtain rise.

00:14:25.090 --> 00:14:28.840
What? Does that mean we don't have a Romeo actor?

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:34.560
Even if I attempted to rewrite the script, Romeo is far too critical a role.

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:37.020
This is bad...

00:14:38.230 --> 00:14:44.730
Rei-san, didn't you say that you've seen the play before, and even read the screenplay?

00:14:44.730 --> 00:14:46.610
Huh? Y-Yeah...

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:49.700
Can we ask you to be a stand-in?

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:52.450
Well, I...

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:56.700
But with so little time, even just memorizing the script would be incredibly difficult.

00:14:56.700 --> 00:15:00.620
Don't worry, Rei-chan's got an amazing memory.

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:02.420
You should take on the challenge!

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:05.960
I'm sure the fairy of victory will be on your side!

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:09.930
I will take care of any mishaps on stage.

00:15:09.930 --> 00:15:12.720
I would love if you could do it!

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:14.970
Me too...

00:15:23.270 --> 00:15:26.400
Got it. Will you lend me a script?

00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:31.280
Now that we're all set, let's get cracking!

00:15:31.280 --> 00:15:33.240
Kirara wants to act too!

00:15:33.240 --> 00:15:35.160
Me too!

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:43.710
Today at five PM, there will be a performance of 
Romeo and Juliet, Four Star version at the small theater.

00:15:43.710 --> 00:15:47.090
Please stop by if you find yourself free.

00:15:53.680 --> 00:15:56.180
Thirty minutes until it starts. {what's the word for the start of a show?}{start?}

00:15:56.180 --> 00:15:57.930
Will we make it?

00:15:57.930 --> 00:16:00.270
I believe in Rei-san.

00:16:01.310 --> 00:16:03.190
Okay, I can do this.

00:16:03.190 --> 00:16:04.190
Thank goodness!

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:05.560
Nice!

00:16:05.560 --> 00:16:09.320
That summarizes the post-play performance program.

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:11.070
Right, got it.

00:16:11.070 --> 00:16:12.570
Here's your outfit.

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:14.450
It fits perfectly.

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:16.580
Rei-chan, you're so handsome!

00:16:16.580 --> 00:16:18.700
I can see the light of hope! {or ray}

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:22.040
Huh? Was there always a fairy role?

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:25.080
I made it for them in short order.

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:27.710
Yay!

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:45.730
O Romeo, Romeo!

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:49.610
Wherefore art thou Romeo?

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:53.650
'Tis but thy name that is my enemy.

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:57.490
I ask of thee, do doff thy name!

00:16:58.160 --> 00:17:01.700
I take thee at thy word. Henceforth shall I be...

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:05.250
Yes, call me but love!

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:08.880
Romeo!

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:10.880
Juliet!

00:17:16.430 --> 00:17:17.680
Juliet... {hey wait a second, this is backwards}

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:33.360
Pouring my soul into this moment!

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:36.860
Kizaki Rei—Everything is for Elza!

00:17:57.880 --> 00:18:00.640
Here we go, this time with a flourish!{wait, was this a before?}{nope, it's new. also I like it}

00:18:09.520 --> 00:18:12.860
I vow eternal radiance upon this dress!

00:21:22.960 --> 00:21:28.350
Rei-san, you have my heartfelt gratitude for saving us from this crisis.

00:21:28.350 --> 00:21:31.100
I feel like I should be thanking you.

00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:35.230
Performing with you was a wonderful experience.

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:38.650
Rei-san, thank you so much.

00:21:38.650 --> 00:21:41.230
You were like a real-live prince.

00:21:41.230 --> 00:21:43.530
Thank you.

00:21:43.530 --> 00:21:47.280
Although I honestly feel a bit conflicted saying that.

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:53.450
It was a new experience for me to enjoy Aikatsu with so many others.

00:21:54.160 --> 00:21:59.130
<i>In the near future, you will save someone from a tight situation.</i>

00:21:59.130 --> 00:22:03.340
<i>Upon doing so, you will have a revelation.</i>

00:22:04.340 --> 00:22:10.970
<i>Elza, today I experienced the unbridled joy of doing Aikatsu in a unit.</i>

00:22:12.060 --> 00:22:16.180
<i>I yearn for nothing more than to share this happiness with you.</i>

00:22:17.690 --> 00:22:20.730
<i>With that, your wish will be realized.</i>

00:22:21.730 --> 00:22:24.360
<i>I'm sure of it.</i>

00:23:55.910 --> 00:24:01.710
My soul was touched by the refinement of your Innocent Prince Coord.

00:24:01.710 --> 00:24:04.290
Performing with you was a lot of fun.

00:24:04.290 --> 00:24:06.670
I've never experienced anything like it before.

00:24:06.670 --> 00:24:09.590
Aikatsu really is so intriguing.

00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:12.930
A unit event?

00:24:12.930 --> 00:24:15.970
I don't recall ever forming a unit with you.

00:24:15.970 --> 00:24:18.640
You keep saying that, but...

00:24:18.640 --> 00:24:20.680
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.680 --> 00:24:21.940
Dream Together.

00:24:21.940 --> 00:24:24.520
Become the first-star idol!
